"""Source facts linking a literal select control to AJAX response rows.

The accepted pattern is deliberately narrow: one ascending loop over a direct
response-path alias in the success callback, creating one option per row with
literal field reads and appending it to a literal-ID document element. Anything
else is omitted rather than approximated.
